        "TileImage": "$($repository 54207b47-c289-49a0-944f-b52201baa429).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your targets Grant Brie and Olive Haskel, far-right hosts of the podcast &quot;Speaking Of Freedom.&quot; They were recently embroiled in controversy when they spent a segment of their show mocking a trans woman named Abigal Forrest. After months of harrassment and being doxxed, Forrest committed suicide. Our client, her grieving partner, has requested, with strictly no collateral damage, that we end their hateful rhetoric, once and for all.\r\r-Diana",
